# Normalize all text files to LF in the repository and in the working tree.
# This matches .editorconfig (end_of_line = lf) and keeps checkouts identical
# across Windows, Linux containers and CI regardless of core.autocrlf.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary formats: never normalize, never diff as text.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.zip binary
*.pfx binary
*.snk binary
*.dll binary
*.exe binary
*.pdf binary
*.msix binary
